{"seq":1,"slug":"controversies","title":"争议","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/sun-tzu/controversies-and-appraisal/controversies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"authorship-and-dating","title":"作者与成书之争","url":"/c/people/sun-tzu/controversies-and-appraisal/controversies/authorship-and-dating","wordCount":2139,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"historicity-questions","title":"历史真实性的疑问","url":"/c/people/sun-tzu/controversies-and-appraisal/controversies/historicity-questions","wordCount":1845,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 争议\n\n本章客观地呈现围绕孙子的主要学术争议。《孙子兵法》的作者与成书年代，连同孙子其人的历史真实性，历史上曾存在疑问；而出土文物，则为澄清这些疑问，提供了重要的佐证。两篇文档，分别呈现作者与成书之争，以及历史真实性的疑问，力求客观而严谨。\n"}